<title>USA: Family Dollar August same store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Family Dollar August same store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>MATTHEWS, N.C. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Family Dollar Stores Inc reported Thursday August, fourth quarter and fiscal year sales.</p>
<p>	    Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $155.6     $129.3     +20.3	+13.0</p>
<p>Q4		  $442.2     $389.8     +13.4	 +6.7</p>
<p>Fiscal year     $1,714     $1,546     +10.8	 +3.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal year ended August 31.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
